{"slug": "het-crematorium-westerveld", "synopsis": "This 1925 silent promotional film shows the Westerveld Crematorium near Velsen, including its landscaped grounds, interior rooms, furnace equipment, and memorial urns. Staff members demonstrate the cremation process by moving a coffin on a wheeled platform, opening the furnace, and placing the coffin inside; an intertitle states that the process ends after one and a half hours. Views of urns, gardens, paths, memorials, and visitors show how cremated remains are kept and commemorated at the site.\\\\n\\\\nDrawn scenes compare cremation with burial and describe cremation as the preferable practice. The film connects that message to Westerveld\u2019s orderly facilities and spacious memorial landscape.", "clips": [{"id": "7e90c289-5102-51a6-b3ca-642bed804dfd", "sourceSlug": "het-crematorium-westerveld", "sourceTitle": "Het crematorium Westerveld", "sourceYear": 1925, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 5.12, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/het-crematorium-westerveld/clips/0000000000-0000005120.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/het-crematorium-westerveld/thumbnails/0000000000-0000005120.jpg"}, {"id": "96622f43-74c8-55f2-9685-f0fc68dec509", "sourceSlug": "het-crematorium-westerveld", "sourceTitle": "Het crematorium Westerveld", "sourceYear": 1925, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 5.12, "endSeconds": 10.0, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/het-crematorium-westerveld/clips/0000005120-0000010000.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/het-crematorium-westerveld/thumbnails/0000005120-0000010000.jpg"}, {"id": "d32f55fc-8a35-59bd-963e-7542db7fca39", "sourceSlug": "het-crematorium-westerveld", "sourceTitle": "Het crematorium Westerveld", "sourceYear": 1925, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 10.0, "endSeconds": 18.6, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff0137